<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-116.1-surety-facility-strategy-provider-management-and-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3641" name="W3641. Surety &amp; Guarantee Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual finance/treasury planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-18); business/B2G strategy
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise surety/guarantee program
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Treasury (links to VS-18), Finance (links to VS-17), B2G Sales (links to VS-46), B2B/Project Sales (links to VS-11), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), Insurance (links to VS-26)
Source: workflow W3641 — Surety &amp; Guarantee Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3641_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3641_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3641_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3641_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3641_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3641_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3641_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3641_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3641_Start4" name="Annual finance/treasury planning (links to VS-33.1/VS-18); business/B2G strategy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3641_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3641_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury define the surety program strategy and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Treasury define the surety program strategy and governance: scope (bid/performance/payment/warranty bonds, bank guarantees, LC-for-guarantee, cash retention/escrow), the instrument-mix strategy (surety bond vs. bank guarantee vs. cash vs. LC by contract type), the regulatory map (RA 9184 government procurement, Insurance Code for surety, BSP for bank guarantees), the operating model, and the KPIs (facility utilization, premium cost, encumbrance, claim rate, release cycle-time)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3641_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3641_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3641_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager establish the governance: Surety Program Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager establish the governance: Surety Program Manager role/authority, the cross-functional responsibilities (Sales initiates the need, Treasury/Finance arranges the instrument, Legal reviews terms, PMO/Operations delivers the contract), the surety policy, and the integration to treasury (VS-18), B2G (VS-46), B2B (VS-11), and risk (VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3641_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3641_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3641_Task7" name="CFO/CEO ratify the surety strategy and policy, approve the authority matrix…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO/CEO ratify the surety strategy and policy, approve the authority matrix (W3647) and facility envelope (W3642), allocate the program budget (links to VS-17.4), and report surety posture and exposure to the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and board (links to VS-36); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): CFO / Surety Program Manager
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3641_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3641_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3641_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3641_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: Surety Program Manager authority; operational: instrument-mix strategy
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3641_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3641_Annotation9" targetRef="W3641_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3641_Flow11" sourceRef="W3641_Start4" targetRef="W3641_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3641_Flow12" sourceRef="W3641_Task5" targetRef="W3641_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3641_Flow13" sourceRef="W3641_Task6" targetRef="W3641_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3641_Flow14" sourceRef="W3641_Task7" targetRef="W3641_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3641_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3641_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3641">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3641_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3641_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3641_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
