    <bpmn:process id="W_W3645" name="W3645. Surety Pricing, Cost &amp; Facility Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Facility renewal (W3642); pricing review; cost-reduction cycle
Frequency: Annual + on renewal
Volume: Surety premium and facility cost
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Treasury (links to VS-18), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Procurement (links to VS-34), Surety Companies/Banks, BI (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3645 — Surety Pricing, Cost &amp; Facility Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3645_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3645_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3645_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3645_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3645_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3645_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3645_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3645_Start3" name="Facility renewal (W3642); pricing review; cost-reduction cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3645_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3645_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury capture and benchmark surety pricing: premium…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Treasury capture and benchmark surety pricing: premium rates by bond type/contract value/risk/term, bank-guarantee fees, LC fees, cash-retention opportunity cost, and collateral cost; benchmark across providers and market
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3645_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3645_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3645_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury optimize the instrument mix and providers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury optimize the instrument mix and providers: surety bond (off-balance-sheet, frees credit) vs. bank guarantee (encumbers credit) vs. cash retention (ties cash) vs. LC, based on cost, capacity, and customer acceptance; consolidate volume for discount and diversify providers for competition
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3645_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3645_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3645_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/Finance publish surety cost analytics and optimization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/Finance publish surety cost analytics and optimization savings to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3661), track cost-per-bond and facility utilization, and feed optimization to facility strategy (W3642) and provider management (W3643)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Finance / BI
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3645_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3645_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3645_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3645_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-577 (ensure controlled execution — Surety Facility Strategy, Provider Management &amp; Program Governance (PA-116.1).) | - operational: benchmarking and competition; operational: instrument-mix analysis
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
