    <bpmn:process id="W_W3646" name="W3646. Surety Risk, Capacity &amp; Encumbrance Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pipeline/bid cycle; capacity review; treasury/cash planning (links to VS-18.1)
Frequency: Monthly + per major bid
Volume: Surety capacity and encumbrance
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Treasury (links to VS-18), B2G/B2B Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Risk (links to VS-21.2), PMO (links to VS-112)
Source: workflow W3646 — Surety Risk, Capacity &amp; Encumbrance Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3646_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3646_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3646_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3646_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3646_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3646_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3646_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3646_Start3" name="Pipeline/bid cycle; capacity review; treasury/cash planning (links to VS-18.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3646_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3646_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Sales forecast the surety demand from the B2G/B2B…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Sales forecast the surety demand from the B2G/B2B pipeline (links to VS-46/VS-11): bid bonds for upcoming tenders, performance bonds for expected awards, warranty bonds for deliveries, by value/term/provider; feed to capacity planning
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Sales
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly + per bid</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3646_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3646_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3646_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Treasury plan surety capacity and facility encumbrance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Treasury plan surety capacity and facility encumbrance: available facility (W3642), outstanding encumbrance (W3654), bank-credit encumbrance (links to VS-18.2), collateral/cash (W3644), and the headroom for new bids; flag capacity constraints and arrange additional facility if needed
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3646_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3646_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3646_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/Risk assess the contingent-liability risk of the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/Risk assess the contingent-liability risk of the outstanding bond/guarantee portfolio (exposure to bond claim W3658), feed to ERM (links to VS-21.2) and treasury/cash planning (links to VS-18.1), and report capacity/encumbrance and risk to governance (W3661) and the risk committee (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Risk / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3646_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3646_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3646_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3646_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: demand forecasting and pre-arranged facility; operational: encumbrance planning and instrument optimization
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
