    <bpmn:process id="W_W3647" name="W3647. Surety Program Policy, Authority &amp; Approval Matrix" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program strategy (W3641); governance cycle; authority change
Frequency: Maintained + on change
Volume: Program policy and authorities
Owner: Surety Program Manager / CFO
Participants: Surety Program Manager, CFO, Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal (links to VS-100.3), B2G/B2B Sales (links to VS-46/VS-11), CEO, Board (links to VS-36), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3647 — Surety Program Policy, Authority &amp; Approval Matrix</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3647_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3647_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3647_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3647_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3647_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3647_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3647_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3647_Start3" name="Program strategy (W3641); governance cycle; authority change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3647_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3647_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/CFO maintain the surety policy: when a bond/guarantee is…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/CFO maintain the surety policy: when a bond/guarantee is required (contract type/value/customer), the instrument-mix rules (W3641), the acceptable providers (W3643), the indemnity/collateral policy (W3644), and the contract-risk-assessment requirement before bonding
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / CFO / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3647_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3647_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3647_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/CFO maintain the approval-authority matrix for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/CFO maintain the approval-authority matrix for bond/guarantee commitments by value/term/risk (Sales Manager → CFO → CEO → Board per links to VS-36), aligned to the capex/commitment authority (links to VS-40) and the board-delegated authorities; manage exceptions
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3647_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3647_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3647_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager/Audit enforce the policy and authority: gate bond…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager/Audit enforce the policy and authority: gate bond issuance on approval (W3649–W3652), audit conformance, manage policy breaches, and report policy/authority effectiveness to governance (W3661) and audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3647_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3647_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3647_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3647_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: issuance gate and audit; operational: annual review
Owner: Surety Program Manager / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3647_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3647_Annotation8" targetRef="W3647_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
