    <bpmn:process id="W_W3648" name="W3648. Surety Program Audit, Documentation &amp; Records" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; claim/dispute
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: Program documentation and records
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Audit
Participants: Surety Program Manager, Audit (links to VS-21), Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17), Records (links to VS-88), Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3648 — Surety Program Audit, Documentation &amp; Records</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3648_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3648_Lane1" name="Surety Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3648_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3648_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3648_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3648_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3648_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3648_Start3" name="Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; claim/dispute">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3648_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3648_Task4" name="Surety Program Manager/Records maintain the surety documentation: facility…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Surety Program Manager/Records maintain the surety documentation: facility agreements (W3642), GAI/counter-indemnity (W3644), provider contracts (W3643), each bond/guarantee instrument (W3650–W3652), the encumbrance register (W3654), releases (W3657), claims (W3658), and correspondence; retention per VS-88 and contract/regulation
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Records
Accountable (A): Surety Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3648_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3648_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3648_Task5" name="Surety Program Manager/Audit conduct the annual surety-program audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Surety Program Manager/Audit conduct the annual surety-program audit: facility/capacity (W3642), encumbrance accuracy (W3654), collateral/indemnity (W3644), policy/authority conformance (W3647), released-bond completeness (W3657), and accounting/disclosure (links to VS-17); internal and (where required) external
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3648_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3648_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3648_Task6" name="Surety Program Manager manage findings to closure, support regulatory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Surety Program Manager manage findings to closure, support regulatory inspection (IC/BSP) and audit response (links to VS-22/W77), and report audit posture to the audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36) and governance (W3661)
Responsible (R): Surety Program Manager / Audit / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3648_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3648_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3648_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3648_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-107 (ensure bond encumbrance &amp; renewal control.) | - operational: documentation discipline; operational: release tracking (W3657) and audit
Owner: Surety Program Manager / Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3648_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3648_Annotation8" targetRef="W3648_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
